1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Has anybody here ever had soju before? No, no.
소주 마셔본 사람? 아니, 없어.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,000
It's a Korean alcohol, made from a variety of sources.
한국 술인데, 재료가 정말 다양해.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
It's kind of in between a wine and a vodka.
도수는 와인이랑 보드카 중간쯤이야.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,000
The flavored ones are very fruit forward, you don't even taste the alcohol.
과일맛은 과일향이 확 나서 술맛이 하나도 안 나.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,500
It's very dangerous. I've gotten snockered on these a couple of times.
그래서 진짜 위험해. 나 이거 마시고 몇 번 뻗었어.

6
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,500
Cheers!
건배!

7
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Yum, it is yummy! That's refreshing.
음~ 맛있다! 완전 상쾌한데?

8
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,000
That tastes like watermelon!
진짜 수박 맛이다!

9
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:43,500
That's a little bit too sweet for me. Too candy.
나한텐 좀 너무 달아. 완전 사탕 같아.

10
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,500
Is anyone getting tipsy yet? Not yet.
슬슬 취하는 사람? 아직.

11
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:53,000
I need to get something savory to eat.
뭔가 짭짤한 거 좀 먹어야겠어.

12
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Green apple, like Granny Smith... like an apple martini!
풋사과 맛이네… 애플 마티니 같아!

13
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:09,000
Plain original soju. Cheers.
이제 그냥 오리지널 소주. 건배.

14
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:15,000
Nope. No. That is like taking a shot of alcohol.
아니, 아니야. 이건 그냥 알코올 원샷이잖아.

15
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:22,000
We should've started with that one.
이걸 제일 먼저 마셨어야 했어.
